# |                                 ANSI_Shadow_Letters                                           |
# +-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
#    Uppercase :    A B C D E F G H I J K L M N Ñ O P Q R S T U V W X Y Z                        
#                                                                                                  
#    Lowercase :    a b c d e f g h i j k l m n ñ o p q r s t u v w x y z       (N/A)                 
#                                                                                                  
#    Shift_Off :    ` 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 0 - = \ [ ] ; ' , . /                                      
#                                                                                                  
#    Shift_On  :    ~ ! @ # $ % ^ & * ( ) _ + | { } : " < > ?                                     
#
#
# +-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
# |                                   KeyBoard Symbol Names                                       |
# +-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
# |   ` : Backtick            - : Minus                = : Equal            \ : Backward_Slash    |
# |   [ : Open_Bracket        ] : Close_Bracket        ; : Semicolon        ' : Apostrophe        |
# |   , : Comma               . : Period               / : Forward_Slash    ~ : Tilde             |
# |   ! : Exclamation         @ : Arroba               # : Pound            $ : Dollar            |
# |   % : Percent             ^ : Caret                & : Ampersand        * : Asterisk          |
# |   ( : Open_Parenthesis    ) : Close_Parenthesis    _ : Underscore       + : Plus              |
# |   | : Pipe                { : Open_Curly           } : Close_Curly      : : Colon             |
# |   " : Quotation           < : Less_Than            > : Greater_Than     ? : Question          |
# +-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

